{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HILARIOUS CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/fa445528cf7513291786812abdde100b.poster.avif?t=1773223672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/fa445528cf7513291786812abdde100b.webm?t=1773223672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/fa445528cf7513291786812abdde100b.mp4?t=1773223672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every guest is here to play nice. Deal with expressive graffiti artists, crazy goose, careless smokers and guests from outer space. Show must go on!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR BUSINESS SOLO OR IN CO-OP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/ba4e5cd89f9eef6138f7d0c6d9f70e8b.poster.avif?t=1773223672\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/ba4e5cd89f9eef6138f7d0c6d9f70e8b.webm?t=1773223672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/ba4e5cd89f9eef6138f7d0c6d9f70e8b.mp4?t=1773223672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and expand your \u0441asino alone or jump into co-op with friends! Assign roles, divide tasks and make profit together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTERTAIN THE GUESTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a